\nまた、PSDファイル上で、セリフや効果音、上記文言なしの差分を付けていただけると幸いです。", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@ecto_SHUKO/works/15", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/f074c020/uploads/origins/cf58fa5a-298f-44df-9a87-9dbde51bae87?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=0ad35a9985c4d7a20af88cd7ff69034c", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/f074c020/uploads/origins/cf58fa5a-298f-44df-9a87-9dbde51bae87?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=0ad35a9985c4d7a20af88cd7ff69034c, https://si.imgix.net/f074c020/uploads/origins/cf58fa5a-298f-44df-9a87-9dbde51bae87?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=5de65d25517750992529e720d6503dab 2x, https://si.imgix.net/f074c020/uploads/origins/cf58fa5a-298f-44df-9a87-9dbde51bae87?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=9763cf751d1ac4413806bc2abed1fb05 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@ecto_SHUKO/works/14", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/3b7f8e9e/uploads/origins/2dff03a1-9630-4e15-8127-0fb9a9b7f162?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=29e82027478c6f32263f14d0e87f2144", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/3b7f8e9e/uploads/origins/2dff03a1-9630-4e15-8127-0fb9a9b7f162?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=29e82027478c6f32263f14d0e87f2144, https://si.imgix.net/3b7f8e9e/uploads/origins/2dff03a1-9630-4e15-8127-0fb9a9b7f162?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=